<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS3" title="In 5 Experiments ‣ FinLFQA: Evaluating Attributed Text Generation of LLMs in Financial Long-Form Question Answering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.3 </span>Main Results</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS3.SSS0.Px1" title="In 5.3 Main Results ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ FinLFQA: Evaluating Attributed Text Generation of LLMs in Financial Long-Form Question Answering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Comparing Model Performance.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS3.SSS0.Px2" title="In 5.3 Main Results ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ FinLFQA: Evaluating Attributed Text Generation of LLMs in Financial Long-Form Question Answering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Fine-grained evaluation metrics provide better comparison.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS3.SSS0.Px3" title="In 5.3 Main Results ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ FinLFQA: Evaluating Attributed Text Generation of LLMs in Financial Long-Form Question Answering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Post-hoc and end-to-end generation show no significant difference.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS3.SSS0.Px4" title="In 5.3 Main Results ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ FinLFQA: Evaluating Attributed Text Generation of LLMs in Financial Long-Form Question Answering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Iterative generation via self-feedback does not improve performance.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS4" title="In 5 Experiments ‣ FinLFQA: Evaluating Attributed Text Generation of LLMs in Financial Long-Form Question Answering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.4 </span>Analysis of Iterative Refinement</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS4.SSS0.Px1" title="In 5.4 Analysis of Iterative Refinement ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ FinLFQA: Evaluating Attributed Text Generation of LLMs in Financial Long-Form Question Answering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Self-feedback alone is insufficient.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS4.SSS0.Px2" title="In 5.4 Analysis of Iterative Refinement ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ FinLFQA: Evaluating Attributed Text Generation of LLMs in Financial Long-Form Question Answering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">External feedback requires sufficient model capacity.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS4.SSS0.Px3" title="In 5.4 Analysis of Iterative Refinement ‣ 5 Experiments ‣ FinLFQA: Evaluating Attributed Text Generation of LLMs in Financial Long-Form Question Answering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Domain-specific feedback improves outcomes.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS5" title="In 5 Experiments ‣ FinLFQA: Evaluating Attributed Text Generation of LLMs in Financial Long-Form Question Answering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.5 </span>Error Analysis</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S6" title="In FinLFQA: Evaluating Attributed Text Generation of LLMs in Financial Long-Form Question Answering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6 </span>Conclusion</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_bibliography"><a href="#bib" title="In FinLFQA: Evaluating Attributed Text Generation of LLMs in Financial Long-Form Question Answering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">References</span></a></li>
